JaPatch Patches NOTICE
====================

Some features are based on ideas from community Discord plugins. The code is written for this
project: it hooks Discord's own pinned 351.11 JavaScript bundle and doesn't include or load
code from any other client mod.

PlatformIndicators uses five device icons from Martinz64/vendetta-plugins, which are released
under The Unlicense. The original icons are kept as they are.

ReviewDB talks to the community ReviewDB service (manti.vendicated.dev) only when you turn it
on. JaPatch isn't affiliated with or endorsed by that service, or by Discord Inc.
Discord is a trademark of Discord Inc.

Quest Completer is based on the approach of community quest scripts: aamiaa's "Complete Recent
Discord Quest" gist, nicola02nb's CompleteDiscordQuest and Equicord's Questify (all GPL-3.0). Its
code is written for this project against Discord 351.11's own modules.

patches/src/main/kotlin/util/PatchListGenerator.kt is adapted from the Morphe patches
template (https://github.com/MorpheApp/morphe-patches-template) and keeps its header.

JaPatch's settings, its 29 language files and its JavaScript runtime are written for this
project. Patches are made against Discord 351.11's own bundled modules; no code is loaded,
injected or interpreted from another client mod at runtime.

ValidUser is based on the ValidUser Revenge plugin by fshin, o.oer and kmmiio99o
(fshinz/Revenge-Plugins). Split Large Messages is based on the SplitLargeMessages Vendetta plugin by
sunnie (sunnniee/vendetta-plugins). Double-tap to reply is based on Geastures+ by kmmiio99o
(https://rksv.kmmiio99o.dev/GeasturesPlus). All three are rewritten for this project against Discord 351.11's modules.

Translate messages uses Google Translate's public web endpoint (translate.googleapis.com) at the user's
request. No Google code is included; translations are Google's.

Server info is based on the idea of fshin's ServerInfo Revenge plugin (fshinz/Revenge-Plugins). Its code
is written for this project against Discord 351.11's own stores and server menu.

Icon packs is based on the idea and community icon pack catalog of nexpid's Themes+ plugin
(nexpid/ThemesPlus), with icon packs created by Rosie, Rairof, Lemon, Jay, Google, Hurricane,
480 Design, WalkQuackBack, doraa and Iconsax. Its code is written for this project against
Discord 351.11's own AssetRegistry and BaseIconImage modules.

Custom branding renames the package, its permission and its providers the same way Morphe's
"Clone app" patch does. Its code is written for this project against Discord 351.11's manifest.

Bring back Tenor GIFs is based on the idea of Livie's BringBackTenor Vendetta plugin (lvwmwm/vendettian-plugins). Its
code is written for this project against Discord 351.11's own GIF picker. It asks Tenor's public v1 API
(g.tenor.com) for GIFs only while it's on. JaPatch isn't affiliated with or endorsed by Tenor or Google.

Developer tooling (taken from Venus Patches)
============================================

The tools that read and verify Discord's bundle are not JaPatch's own work. They come from Venus
Patches (https://github.com/VenusIsJaded/Venus-Patches, GPL-3.0) and are used as they are:

  scripts/hbc/hbc.py, ops.txt, setup.sh, DexInspect.kt, color_tables.py, hermes_vm.sh
  scripts/verify_apk.sh
  tests/test_all.sh
  tests/ui/sheet.py, tests/themes_fetch.py, tests/bench/load_calls.cjs
  extensions/voice/stubs/com/facebook/react/bridge/Promise.kt

The Gradle scaffold, .editorconfig, .gitattributes, the Gradle wrapper and PatchListGenerator.kt come
from the Morphe patches template, as the line below already says. Everything else in this repository -
the patches, the JavaScript runtime, the settings pages and the 34 language files - is written for
JaPatch against Discord 351.11's own modules.

Venus Patches is GPL-3.0, the same licence as this repository, so the code is used and shared under
those terms. Venus is not asked about, nor does it endorse, anything here.

Who wrote this
